{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28051","headline":"望九华山 · 柴夔","name":"望九华山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九华如剑插云霓，青霭连空望欲迷。\n北截吴门疑地尽，南连楚界觉天低。\n龙池水蘸中秋月，石路人攀上汉梯。\n惆怅旧游无复到，会须登此出尘泥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柴夔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28051.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28051","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}